# Zustand Store Patterns

## Entity Stores (FSD: `entities/<name>/<name>.model.ts`)

| Entity | Store file | Responsibility |
|--------|-----------|---------------|
| `entities/instance/` | `instance.model.ts` | Zulip instances (realm, email, apiKey), persisted in localStorage |
| `entities/chat-list/` | `chat-list.model.ts` | Streams, DMs, topics, unread counts — derived from messages |
| `entities/message/` | `message.model.ts` | Messages for active chat context |
| `entities/user/` | `user.model.ts` | User profiles, presence, avatar URLs |
| `entities/theme/` | `theme.model.ts` | Theme mode + palette |
| `entities/call/` | `call.model.ts` | Jitsi call participants |
| `entities/sticker/` | `sticker.model.ts` | Sticker packs, favorites, recent |
| `entities/folder/` | `folder.api.ts` | Folder API integration |

## Feature Stores (FSD: `features/<name>/<name>.model.ts`)

| Feature | Store file | Responsibility |
|---------|-----------|---------------|
| `features/ai-reply/` | `ai-reply.model.ts` | AI reply suggestions state |

## Creating New Entity Store

```ts
// entities/foo/foo.model.ts
import { create } from "zustand";
import { logStoreAction } from "~/shared/lib/logger";

interface FooState {
  items: FooItem[];
  loading: boolean;
  setItems: (items: FooItem[]) => void;
  addItem: (item: FooItem) => void;
  clear: () => void;
}

export const useFooStore = create<FooState>((set, get) => ({
  items: [],
  loading: false,
  setItems: (items) => {
    logStoreAction("foo", "setItems", { count: items.length });
    set({ items, loading: false });
  },
  addItem: (item) => set((s) => ({ items: [...s.items, item] })),
  clear: () => set({ items: [], loading: false }),
}));
```

Import the store from the **concrete model file** (no barrel `index.ts` re-exports — see `no-barrel-index.mdc`):

```ts
import { useFooStore } from "~/entities/foo/foo.model";
```

## Patterns

- Immutable updates: spread operator or `new Map(existing)`
- Cross-store access: `useOtherStore.getState()` (not a hook, only inside actions)
- Derived data: cached getters (see `performance.mdc` anti-pattern #1)
- Persistence: `persist` middleware from zustand, key in localStorage
- Events from real-time loop update stores via entity store actions
- Map pattern for indexed data: `new Map<number, Item>()`
- Logging: `logStoreAction("scope", "action", { data })` in every action
- Empty fallbacks: use module-level constants (`const EMPTY: T[] = []`), never inline `[]`
